  "red_reason": "The staged gate returned success for backspace in maintained text, and all 29 forbidden-ASCII subtests lacked the required ASCII diagnostic (some controls caused false splitlines-based trailing-whitespace errors). Existing NUL/CR and valid UTF-8/TAB/LF cases passed.",
  "policy": "Reject U+0001..U+001F except TAB/LF; CR retains its existing LF line-ending error, and NUL retains its existing ValueError. Reject ASCII DEL U+007F because it is another nonprinting ASCII control that can silently corrupt authored prose. No Unicode category, bidi, suffix, exclusion or selection policy change.",
